  <!-- ===================== SENTIMENT REGIME — Froth & Fragility + Fear↔Euphoria (display-only conditioning lenses; merged scorecard) ===================== -->
  {% if mode != 'stocks' and (froth_fragility or fear_euphoria) %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="sentiment-regime">
    <h2>{{ t('Sentiment regime — froth, fear &amp; euphoria', '情绪周期 — 狂热、恐惧与欣喜') }}
      {{ help("Two display-only regime lenses in one card. Froth & Fragility — a top-risk gauge that fuses retail EUPHORIA (semis/AI parabolicity) with hidden DISTRIBUTION (a rotating decline under a pinned index) — the leading internals a single VIX read misses; only EUPHORIC AND FRAGILE together is a distribution-top risk, and the only sanctioned response is SIZING (de-risk), never selection. Fear ↔ Euphoria — a conditioning read that synthesises the cross-asset RORO risk-appetite composite, the dislocation verdict and the capitulation gauge into one 0-100 regime score. NEITHER scores direction or sizes positions; neither feeds the quad, the macro-risk score or any axis.", "两个仅供展示的周期视角合于一卡。狂热与脆弱 — 顶部风险计，融合零售欣喜（半导体/AI 抛物化）与隐性派发（被托住指数下的轮动式下行）——单看 VIX 会错过的领先内部指标；唯有“欣喜且脆弱”同时出现才是派发顶部风险，唯一被许可的回应是减仓，绝非选股。恐惧↔欣喜 — 综合跨资产 RORO 风险偏好综合、错位读数与投降指标，形成单一的 0-100 周期评分。两者都不评分方向、不决定仓位；都不进入象限、宏观风险评分或任何轴。") }}
      <a href="macro_signals.html" class="muted" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:400;margin-left:auto">{{ t('full breakdown →','完整拆解 →') }}</a>
    </h2>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:-4px 0 14px">{{ t('Conditioning lenses, not signals — they synthesise components this dashboard already computes and never score direction or size positions.', '环境视角，而非信号 — 仅综合本仪表盘已计算的成分，绝不评分方向或决定仓位。') }}</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px 22px">

      <!-- Froth & Fragility -->
      {% if froth_fragility %}
      {% set ff = froth_fragility %}
      {% set ffc = 'var(--up)' if ff.band == 'calm' else ('var(--warn)' if ff.band in ['watch','elevated'] else 'var(--down)') %}
      {% set ax = ff.face_a.score if ff.face_a.score is not none else 0 %}
      {% set bx = ff.face_b.score if ff.face_b.score is not none else 0 %}
      <section style="flex:1 1 320px;min-width:0;border-left:3px solid {{ ffc }};padding-left:14px">
        <h3 style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:0">{{ t('Froth & Fragility', '狂热与脆弱') }}
          {% if ff.headline is not none %}<span style="margin-left:auto;color:{{ ffc }};font-weight:800;font-size:16px">{{ ff.headline|round|int }}<small style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)">/100 · {{ t(ff.band|capitalize, ff.band_zh) }}</small></span>{% endif %}
          {{ help("A top-risk gauge that measures what a single VIX read cannot: retail EUPHORIA (semis/AI parabolicity) AND hidden DISTRIBUTION (a rotating decline under a pinned index, where the cap-weighted index and VIX stay calm because the leaders take turns falling / rotation holds the tape up). The honest read is the 2D danger-quadrant: only EUPHORIC AND FRAGILE together is a distribution-top risk. VIX is coincident index implied-vol — it is √ρ·σ̄, so falling single-stock correlation mechanically pins it low while internal risk builds; this gauge fuses the LEADING internals it misses. DISPLAY-ONLY / validation-accruing: it feeds NO score and NO allocation — the only sanctioned response is SIZING (de-risk), never selection. Each firing is logged and graded on forward QQQ/SMH drawdown + VIX jump.", "一个顶部风险计，衡量单看 VIX 无法捕捉的两面：零售欣喜（半导体/AI 抛物化）与隐性派发（被托住的指数下的轮动式下行：龙头轮流下跌或板块轮动撑住大盘，使市值加权指数与 VIX 保持平静）。诚实读法是二维危险象限：唯有“欣喜且脆弱”同时出现才是派发顶部风险。VIX 是同步的指数隐含波动率——约等于 √ρ·σ̄，因此个股相关性下降会机械地把它压低，而内部风险却在累积；本计融合它错过的领先内部指标。仅供展示／积累验证：不计分、不驱动仓位——唯一被许可的回应是减仓，绝非选股。每次触发都会记录并以未来 QQQ/SMH 回撤与 VIX 跳升评分。") }}
        </h3>
        {% if ff.face_a.score is not none or ff.face_b.score is not none %}
        <div style="margin-top:2px;font-weight:700;color:{{ ffc }}">{{ t(ff.quadrant_en, ff.quadrant_zh) }}
          {% if ff.provisional %}<span class="badge sm" style="margin-left:6px" title="forward record still accruing">{{ t('provisional', '暂定') }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if ff.unwind_risk %}<span class="badge sm" style="margin-left:6px;color:var(--down)" title="correlation snapping back">⚠ {{ t('unwind risk','解构风险') }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:6px">{{ t('Euphoria','欣喜') }} <b style="color:var(--text)">{{ ax|round|int }}</b>/100 · {{ t('Fragility / distribution','脆弱／派发') }} <b style="color:var(--text)">{{ bx|round|int }}</b>/100</div>
        {% else %}
        <p class="muted sm">{{ t('Not enough data to compute the gauge right now.','当前数据不足以计算该指标。') }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <p class="muted sm" style="margin:8px 0 0">{% if ff.track_record and ff.track_record.n %}{{ t('Forward record','前瞻记录') }}: {{ ff.track_record.n }} {{ t('firings','次触发') }} · {{ (ff.track_record.hit_rate * 100)|round|int }}% {{ t('hit','命中') }}. {% else %}{{ t('Forward record accruing.','前瞻记录积累中。') }} {% endif %}{{ t('Display-only — the response is sizing, not selection.','仅供展示——应对是调整仓位，而非选股。') }}</p>
      </section>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Fear ↔ Euphoria -->
      {% if fear_euphoria %}
      {% set FE = fear_euphoria %}
      {% set _bandzh = {'Panic':'恐慌','Fear':'恐惧','Neutral':'中性','Greed':'贪婪','Euphoria':'欣喜'} %}
      <section style="flex:1 1 320px;min-width:0">
        <h3 style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:0">{{ t('Fear ↔ Euphoria: regime synthesis', '恐惧 ↔ 欣喜：周期综合') }}
          {{ help("A conditioning lens, NOT a signal. It synthesises components this dashboard already computes — the cross-asset RORO risk-appetite composite, the dislocation verdict and the capitulation gauge — into one Fear↔Euphoria regime read. It does NOT score direction or size positions, and never feeds the quad, the macro-risk score or any axis. 'Contrarian at extremes' is regime-dependent: fear is buyable only when the Fed put is present; in put-absent regimes extreme fear can be a falling knife.", "这是环境视角，不是信号。它综合本仪表盘已计算的成分 — 跨资产 RORO 风险偏好综合、错位读数与投降指标 — 形成单一的恐惧↔欣喜周期读数。它不评分方向、不决定仓位，也绝不进入象限、宏观风险评分或任何轴。'极端时反向操作'取决于周期：只有在美联储托底在位时，恐惧才可买入；托底缺失时，极端恐惧可能是下跌中的刀子。") }}
        </h3>
        <div style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{ t('Fear ↔ Euphoria', '恐惧 ↔ 欣喜') }}
            <span style="font-size:22px">{{ FE.fe_score }}</span><span class="muted" style="font-size:13px">/100</span>
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;vertical-align:middle;background:var(--panel)">{{ t(FE.band, _bandzh.get(FE.band, FE.band)) }}</span>
            {% if FE.roro is not none %}<span class="muted sm" style="float:right">RORO {{ '%+.2f'|format(FE.roro) }}{% if FE.roro_state %} <span class="pill" style="background:var(--panel)">{{ td(FE.roro_state) }}</span>{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="pgauge" style="width:100%"><i style="left: {{ FE.fe_score }}%"></i></div>
          <div class="pends"><span>← {{ t('Fear', '恐惧') }}</span><span>{{ t('Euphoria', '欣喜') }} →</span></div>
          <div class="pends" style="margin-top:3px">
            <span{% if FE.band=='Panic' %} style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700"{% endif %}>{{ t('Panic', '恐慌') }}</span>
            <span{% if FE.band=='Fear' %} style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700"{% endif %}>{{ t('Fear', '恐惧') }}</span>
            <span{% if FE.band=='Neutral' %} style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700"{% endif %}>{{ t('Neutral', '中性') }}</span>
            <span{% if FE.band=='Greed' %} style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700"{% endif %}>{{ t('Greed', '贪婪') }}</span>
            <span{% if FE.band=='Euphoria' %} style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700"{% endif %}>{{ t('Euphoria', '欣喜') }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t("Today's score is the rolling-5-year percentile of the RORO composite (valid after ~2.5y). 'Contrarian at extremes' is regime-dependent — see the dislocation read below.", '今日评分为 RORO 综合的滚动五年百分位（约 2.5 年后有效）。"极端时反向操作"取决于周期 — 见下方错位读数。') }}</div>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% endif %}

    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== CROSS-ASSET MACRO — Rates & inflation transmission + Bonds & FX cross-check (merged scorecard; context-only) ===================== -->
  {% set _rit = latest.rate_inflation_transmission if (latest.rate_inflation_transmission and latest.rate_inflation_transmission.state) else None %}
  {% set _cac = latest.cross_asset_confirm if (latest.cross_asset_confirm and latest.cross_asset_confirm.verdict not in [none, 'unknown']) else None %}
  {% if _rit or _cac %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="cross-asset-macro">
    <h2>{{ t('Rates, bonds &amp; FX — cross-asset check', '利率、债券与外汇 — 跨资产校验') }}
      {{ help("Two context-only cross-asset reads in one card. Rates & inflation — how today's rates and inflation help or hurt each asset class (green = tailwind, red = headwind): a read on pressure, not a buy/sell call. Bonds & FX cross-check — bonds and the dollar move faster than stocks, so this checks whether they confirm the equity read (AGREE = the move has support; DIVERGE = a yellow flag). Neither is a buy/sell signal; the full cause-and-effect breakdown is on the Transmission page.", "两个仅供参考的跨资产读数合于一卡。利率与通胀 — 当前利率与通胀如何利好或利空各类资产（绿色＝顺风，红色＝逆风）：判断压力，而非买卖信号。债券与外汇交叉验证 — 债券与美元比股票反应更快，因此检查它们是否确认股市读数（一致＝走势有支撑；背离＝黄旗）。两者都不是买卖信号；完整的因果分解见“传导”页面。") }}
      <a href="transmission.html" style="margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;font-weight:600">{{ t('Transmission page →', '传导页面 →') }}</a>
    </h2>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:-4px 0 14px">{{ t('Context only, never a buy/sell signal — macro pressure on each asset class, and whether the fast markets confirm the equity move.', '仅供参考，绝非买卖信号 — 各类资产承受的宏观压力，以及快速市场是否确认股票走势。') }}</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px 22px">

      <!-- Rates & inflation — who it helps, who it hurts -->
      {% if _rit %}
      {% set rit = _rit %}
      <section style="flex:1 1 320px;min-width:0">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">{{ t('Rates & inflation — who it helps, who it hurts', '利率与通胀 — 利好谁、利空谁') }}
          {{ help("How today's interest rates and inflation help or hurt each asset class. Green = tailwind, red = headwind. It's a read on pressure, not a buy/sell call. The full cause-and-effect breakdown is on the Transmission page.", "当前利率与通胀如何利好或利空各类资产。绿色＝顺风，红色＝逆风。这是对压力的判断，而非买卖信号。完整的因果分解见“传导”页面。") }}
        </h3>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;margin:4px 0 12px;font-size:13px">
          <span>{{ t('Rates','利率') }}: <b><span class="l-en">{{ rit.state.rates.label.en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ rit.state.rates.label.zh }}</span></b></span>
          <span>{{ t('Inflation','通胀') }}: <b><span class="l-en">{{ rit.state.inflation.label.en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ rit.state.inflation.label.zh }}</span></b></span>
          <span>{{ t('Expectations','预期') }}: <b><span class="l-en">{{ rit.state.expectations.label.en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ rit.state.expectations.label.zh }}</span></b></span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;font-size:13px">
          <div><span class="tone-down" style="font-weight:700">{{ t('Headwind','逆风') }}</span>
            {% for h in rit.headwinds[:3] %}<div style="margin-top:5px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:baseline"><span><span class="l-en">{{ h.label.en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ h.label.zh }}</span></span> <b class="wind head">{{ '%.2f'|format(h.net) }}</b></div>{% else %}<div class="muted">—</div>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div><span class="tone-up" style="font-weight:700">{{ t('Tailwind','顺风') }}</span>
            {% for h in rit.tailwinds[:3] %}<div style="margin-top:5px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:baseline"><span><span class="l-en">{{ h.label.en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ h.label.zh }}</span></span> <b class="wind tail">+{{ '%.2f'|format(h.net) }}</b></div>{% else %}<div class="muted">—</div>{% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="muted sm" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t('A read on risk, not return — context only.', '仅作风险判断而非回报，仅供参考。') }}</p>
      </section>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Bonds & FX cross-check — do they confirm stocks? -->
      {% if _cac %}
      {% set cac = _cac %}
      {% set _cvtone = 'up' if cac.verdict == 'confirm' else ('down' if cac.verdict == 'diverge' else 'flat') %}
      <section style="flex:1 1 320px;min-width:0">
        <h3 style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:0">{{ t('Bonds & FX cross-check — do they confirm stocks?', '债券与外汇交叉验证 — 是否确认股票？') }}
          <span class="badge tone-{{ _cvtone }}">{{ t(cac.verdict, cac.verdict_zh) }}{% if cac.agree_pct is not none %} · {{ cac.agree_pct }}%{% endif %}</span>
          {{ help("Bonds and the dollar move faster than stocks, so this checks whether they agree with the stock-market read. They AGREE = the move has support; they DIVERGE = a yellow flag worth watching. Context only, never a buy/sell signal.", "债券与美元比股票反应更快，因此本面板检查它们是否认同股市读数。一致＝走势有支撑；背离＝值得留意的黄旗。仅供参考，绝非买卖信号。") }}
        </h3>
        <div style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var({{ '--up' if _cvtone=='up' else ('--down' if _cvtone=='down' else '--muted') }});border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-weight:600">
          {{ t(cac.headline_en, cac.headline_zh) }}
        </div>
        {% if cac.cycle %}
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:8px">
          {{ t('Cycle clock', '周期时钟') }}: {{ t('equities', '股票') }} <b>{{ td(cac.cycle.equity) if cac.cycle.equity else '—' }}</b>
          · {{ t('bonds', '债券') }} <b>{{ t(cac.cycle.bonds_en or cac.cycle.bonds or '—', cac.cycle.bonds_zh or cac.cycle.bonds or '—') }}</b>
          {% if cac.cycle.fx_regime %} · {{ t('dollar-smile', '美元微笑') }} <b>{{ t(cac.cycle.fx_regime, cac.cycle.fx_regime_zh or cac.cycle.fx_regime) }}</b>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:10px">
          {% for leg in cac.legs %}
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start">
            <span class="sstack-dot tone-{{ leg.tone }}" style="margin-top:5px;flex:0 0 auto"></span>
            <div><b>{{ t(leg.label_en, leg.label_zh) }}</b> — <span class="muted">{{ t(leg.detail_en, leg.detail_zh) }}</span></div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% if cac.caution_flags %}
        <div style="margin-top:10px">
          <div class="sm" style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('Watch flags', '关注信号') }}</div>
          {% for f in cac.caution_flags %}
          <div class="sm" style="padding:4px 8px;margin:3px 0;border-left:3px solid var({{ '--down' if f.severity=='high' else ('--warn' if f.severity=='medium' else '--muted') }});background:var(--panel2);border-radius:4px">{{ t(f.en, f.zh) }}</div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <p class="muted sm" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t(cac.note_en, cac.note_zh) }}</p>
      </section>
      {% endif %}

    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== MAJOR US INDEXES — HEALTH & RISK ===================== -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="index-health">
    <h2>{{ t('Major US indexes — health & drawdown risk', '美国主要指数 — 健康度与回撤风险') }}
      {{ help("How the market itself is doing, before the economy. Price, % below the 52-week high (drawdown), trend vs the 50/200-day averages, and RSI(14) for the four major US indexes — alongside the validated macro de-risk read that drives the allocation strategy.", "在看经济之前，先看市场本身。四大美国指数的价格、距52周高点的回撤、相对50/200日均线的趋势、RSI(14) — 以及驱动仓位策略的经验证宏观降险读数。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="idx-grid">
      {% for ix in index_health %}
      <div class="idx-tile">
        <div class="idx-top"><b>{{ t(ix.label, ix.label_zh) }}</b> <span class="idx-px">{{ '%.2f'|format(ix.price) }}</span></div>
        <div class="idx-row">
          <span class="{{ 'pos' if ix.dd >= -1 else ('warn' if ix.dd >= -10 else 'neg') }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(ix.dd) }}% {{ t('off high', '距高点') }}</span>
          <span>RSI {{ ix.rsi if ix.rsi is not none else '—' }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="idx-trend">
          <span class="{{ 'pos' if ix.above200 else 'neg' }}">{{ '✓' if ix.above200 else '✕' }} 200d</span>
          <span class="{{ 'pos' if ix.above50 else 'neg' }}">{{ '✓' if ix.above50 else '✕' }} 50d</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="idx-risk">
      {% set dr = latest.conditions.drawdown_risk %}
      {% set rc = latest.conditions.recession %}
      {# Slow macro/credit drawdown gauge. Relabelled to the engine's OWN lagging identity
         (dr.label/dr.label_zh) so it no longer collides word-for-word with the leading Risk
         Radar banner above — a different NAME + 63d horizon stops 15 vs 91 reading as one
         metric self-contradicting. Low-band 8% is the unconditional base rate, shown as such
         (never as "calm"). See the radar reconciliation note just below the grid. #}
      <div class="idx-gauge">
        <div class="idx-gk" title="Slow macro/credit composite (recession risk, NFCI, EBP, HY OAS) · lags price · 63-day horizon · for near-term timing see the Risk Radar above · 慢速宏观/信用综合（衰退风险、NFCI、EBP、高收益利差）· 滞后于价格 · 63日窗口 · 近端择时见上方风险雷达">
          {% if dr and dr.label %}{{ t(dr.label, dr.label_zh or dr.label) }}{% else %}{{ t('Macro/credit drawdown pressure (lagging)', '宏观/信用回撤压力（滞后）') }}{% endif %}
          {{ help('A SLOW macro/credit composite (recession risk, NFCI, EBP, HY OAS) over a 63-day horizon — it LAGS price, so a low read here is NOT a near-term all-clear: in the low band the figure equals the unconditional base rate (no forward edge). For the leading, near-term (≤21d) drawdown-odds read, trust the Risk Radar at the top of the Market State board above. The two answer different questions and can legitimately disagree.', '慢速的宏观/信用综合指标（衰退风险、NFCI、EBP、高收益利差），观察窗口为63日 — 它滞后于价格，因此此处读数偏低并不代表近端“安全”：在低区间内该数值等于无条件基准概率（无前瞻信号）。近端（≤21日）的领先回撤概率，请以上方市场状态板顶部的风险雷达为准。两者回答的是不同问题，出现分歧属正常。') }}
        </div>
        <div class="idx-gv">{{ dr.score|round|int if dr and dr.score is not none else '—' }}<small>/100{% if dr and dr.lead_lag %} · {{ t('lagging', '滞后') }}{% endif %}</small></div>
        {% if dr and dr.dd10_prob_pct is not none %}
          {% if dr.dd10_prob_informative %}
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('P(≥10% / 63d)', '概率(≥10%/63日)') }} <b>{{ dr.dd10_prob_pct }}%</b></div>
          {% elif dr.is_base_rate %}
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ dr.dd10_prob_pct }}% = {{ t('base rate · no forward edge', '基准概率 · 无前瞻信号') }} <span style="color:var(--ink-3)">(≥10% / 63d)</span></div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="idx-gauge">
        <div class="idx-gk">{{ t('Recession risk', '衰退风险') }}</div>
        <div class="idx-gv">{{ rc.score|round|int if rc and rc.score is not none else '—' }}<small>/100</small></div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{% if rc and rc.label %}{{ td(rc.label) }}{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      {% if alloc_card and alloc_card.present %}
      <a class="idx-alloc" href="spvector.html">
        <div class="idx-gk">{{ t('S&P Vector allocation', '标普向量仓位') }} →</div>
        <div class="idx-gv" style="color:{{ 'var(--up)' if alloc_card.band == 'low' else ('var(--warn)' if alloc_card.band in ['elevated','high'] else 'var(--down)') }}">{{ alloc_card.equity_w }}%<small> {{ t('equity', '股票') }}</small></div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('de-risk score', '降险分') }} {{ alloc_card.score }} · Sharpe {{ alloc_card.sharpe }} · MaxDD {{ alloc_card.maxdd }}%</div>
      </a>
      {% else %}
      <a class="idx-alloc" href="spvector.html">
        <div class="idx-gk">◎ {{ t('Allocation strategy', '仓位策略') }} →</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:4px">{{ t('S&P 500 ↔ T-bills — a validated drawdown / Sharpe engine.', '标普500 ↔ 短债 — 经验证的回撤 / 夏普引擎。') }}</div>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {# Reconciliation — sibling BELOW the 3-col grid (never a 4th cell). Fires ONLY when the leading
       Risk Radar is loud, so the slow gauge's low read above can never be misread as an all-clear
       while the banner screams caution. Defers to the banner: names state+score once as a pointer,
       does NOT restate its 5d/10d/21d odds. None-safe (triple-guarded). #}
    {% if market_state and market_state.radar and market_state.radar.is_loud %}
    {% set rd = market_state.radar %}
    {% set rdcol = 'var(--down)' if rd.state == 'risk-off' else ('var(--orange)' if rd.state == 'elevated' else 'var(--warn)') %}
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px;margin:8px 0 0;border-left:3px solid {{ rdcol }};padding-left:9px">
      {{ t('This macro/credit gauge is slow and lagging — a low read here is not an all-clear.', '此宏观/信用指标为慢速、滞后指标 — 低读数并不代表解除警报。') }}
      {{ t('The leading, near-term Risk Radar above is louder', '上方领先的近期风险雷达更为响亮') }}
      (<b style="color:{{ rdcol }}">{{ t(rd.state|upper, rd.state_zh) }}{% if rd.top_score is not none %} {{ rd.top_score }}/100{% endif %}</b>{% if rd.label_en %} — {{ t(rd.label_en, rd.label_zh) }}{% endif %}){{ t(' — it is the ≤21-day read to trust for timing.', ' — 它是择时应信赖的≤21日读数。') }}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if risk_model and risk_model.legs %}
    <h3 style="margin-top:16px">{{ t('Index risk model — what is driving de-risk', '指数风险模型 — 降险信号由什么驱动') }}
      {{ help("The S&P Vector de-risk score (0-100) and the legs that build it: macro-stress drawdown gauge, recession risk, financial conditions, credit-spread widening, and net-liquidity. Each leg's points sum to the score, so the bar shows exactly what is risk-on or risk-off now. The full allocation strategy + backtest lives on the S&P Vector page.", "标普向量降险评分（0-100）及其构成分项：宏观压力回撤计、衰退风险、金融条件、信用利差走阔、净流动性。各分项贡献分相加即为总分，进度条直观显示当前什么在加／降风险。完整仓位策略与回测见标普向量页。") }}
    </h3>
    <div class="rm-bar">{% for lg in risk_model.legs %}{% if lg.active and lg.points %}<div style="width:{{ lg.points }}%;background:{{ lg.color }}" title="{{ lg.label }}: {{ lg.points }}"></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
    <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('Filled = de-risk score out of 100.', '填充 = 满分100的降险评分。') }} <a href="spvector.html" style="font-weight:600">{{ t('Full allocation strategy →', '完整仓位策略 →') }}</a></div>
    <table class="rm-tbl">
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('Risk leg', '风险分项') }}</th><th>{{ t('Intensity', '强度') }}</th><th>{{ t('Weight', '权重') }}</th><th>{{ t('Pub lag', '发布滞后') }}</th><th>{{ t('Points', '贡献') }}</th></tr>
      {% for lg in risk_model.legs %}
      <tr><td class="l"><span class="rm-dot" style="background:{{ lg.color }}"></span>{{ t(lg.label, lg.label_zh) }}</td>
        <td>{{ (lg.value|round|int ~ '/100') if lg.value is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.1f'|format(lg.weight) }}</td>
        <td>{{ lg.lag }}d</td>
        <td><b>{{ ('%.1f'|format(lg.points)) if lg.points is not none else '—' }}</b></td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr><td class="l"><b>{{ t('De-risk score', '降险评分') }}</b></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td><b>{{ risk_model.score }}</b></td></tr>
    </table>
    {% endif %}
    {% if chart_risk_model %}
    <h3 style="margin-top:16px">{{ t('Drawdown & recession risk — modeled (NBER recessions shaded)', '回撤与衰退风险 — 模型（阴影为NBER衰退期）') }}</h3>
    <div>{{ chart_risk_model | safe }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if chart_curve or chart_vix_term %}
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px">
      {% if chart_curve %}
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>{{ t('Yield curve — recession lead', '收益率曲线 — 衰退先行指标') }}
          {{ help("The 2-year/10-year slope, raw vs term-premium-adjusted. Below zero (inversion) is the classic recession lead. The TP-adjusted line strips the term premium so a low-term-premium flattening (e.g. 2022-24) isn't misread as a recession signal. NBER recessions shaded.", "2年／10年期利差，原始值对比剥离期限溢价后。低于零（倒挂）是经典的衰退先行信号。剥离期限溢价的线条避免把低期限溢价导致的平坦化（如 2022–24）误读为衰退信号。阴影为 NBER 衰退期。") }}
        </h3>
        <div>{{ chart_curve | safe }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if chart_vix_term %}
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>{{ t('Volatility regime — VIX term structure', '波动率状态 — VIX 期限结构') }}
          {{ help("VIX level (top) and the VIX/VIX3M term-structure ratio (bottom). Ratio above 1.0 = backwardation (front-month fear exceeds 3-month) — a stress / washout marker; the curve re-normalising back below 1.0 has historically been the constructive all-clear.", "VIX 水平（上）与 VIX/VIX3M 期限结构比率（下）。比率高于 1.0＝backwardation（近月恐慌高于三个月）— 是压力／恐慌底标记；曲线回落至 1.0 以下在历史上是具建设性的“警报解除”。") }}
        </h3>
        <div>{{ chart_vix_term | safe }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {# market-tiles panel retired — redundant cross-asset level strip, folded into the Market State command-center #}

  {# time-machine panel retired — low decision value (interactive scrubber retired); timemachine.js no-ops when its elements are absent #}
  {# market-tiles retired — folded into the Market State command-center #}

  {# time-machine retired — folded into the Market State command-center #}

  {# Fired alerts moved into the combined "Now" board (alerts · news · relief radar) below. #}

  {# Risk Radar standalone card removed — its headline + (on risk-off) the scare-type
     breakdown now live in the Market State banner; full per-scare detail + self-audit
     are on the Macro Signals data page (macro_signals.html). #}

  <!-- ============ EARLY RISK-STATE BANNER (engine/risk_state.py) — fallback when Risk Radar v2 absent ============ -->
  {% set RS = latest.risk_state %}
  {% if not latest.risk_radar and RS and RS.score is not none and RS.state in ['caution','elevated','risk-off'] %}
  {% set rscol = 'var(--act)' if RS.state=='risk-off' else ('var(--orange)' if RS.state=='elevated' else 'var(--warn)') %}
  {% set rsglow = 'rgba(224,85,85,.55)' if RS.state=='risk-off' else ('rgba(224,139,69,.5)' if RS.state=='elevated' else 'rgba(224,160,48,.4)') %}
  {% set rsicon = '🛑' if RS.state=='risk-off' else ('🚨' if RS.state=='elevated' else '⚠️') %}
  <div class="panel span12{% if RS.alert %} rs-float rs-loud{% endif %}" id="risk-state" style="--rs:{{ rscol }};--rs-glow:{{ rsglow }}">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
      <div class="rs-head">{{ rsicon }} {{ t('Market risk state', '市场风险状态') }}: {{ t(RS.label_en, RS.label_zh) }}
        {{ help('A fused EARLY-warning risk state from the equity-internal detectors the credit-weighted macro gauge misses: complacency / hidden-fragility, breadth divergence, dealer-gamma posture, vol-term structure, HY + HYG-TLT credit, plus turning-point and cross-asset confirms. Leading positioning/vol/breadth legs are weighted far above the slow credit/recession legs, so this LEADS the macro-risk gauge into a positioning/vol/breadth blow-off (e.g. the 2026-06-23 semi unwind, when macro-risk still read low). A conjunction-based CONTEXT, not validated alpha: the de-risk response is SIZING — de-gross, favour good entries over chasing extended leaders — never stock selection, and it does not alter the validated regime quad. See research/RISK_LAYER_DESIGN.md.', '融合的“早期”风险状态，取自信用加权宏观指标看不到的股票内部探测器：自满度／隐性脆弱、宽度背离、做市商Gamma、波动期限结构、HY 与 HYG-TLT 信用，外加拐点与跨资产确认。领先的仓位／波动／宽度因子权重远高于缓慢的信用／衰退因子，因此在仓位／波动／宽度型见顶中领先于宏观风险指标（如 2026-06-23 半导体崩跌时宏观风险仍读数偏低）。这是基于“组合共振”的背景，而非经验证的超额收益：应对是调整仓位——降低敞口、择优入场而非追逐已延展的龙头——绝非选股，且不改变经验证的区制四象限。详见 research/RISK_LAYER_DESIGN.md。') }}
      </div>
      <div class="rs-head rs-score">{{ RS.score|round|int }}<span class="muted" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600">/100</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:4px 0 10px">{{ t(RS.headline_en, RS.headline_zh) }}</p>
    {% if RS.drivers %}
    <div style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px">
      <div class="sm" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px">{{ t('What is firing', '正在触发的因子') }}</div>
      {% for d in RS.drivers[:5] %}
      <div class="rs-driver sm">
        <span class="rs-bar" style="width:{{ (d.intensity*60)|round|int + 8 }}px"></span>
        <span>{{ t(d.detail_en, d.detail_zh) }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="sm" style="margin-top:9px"><b>{{ t('Do', '应对') }}:</b> {{ t(RS.reader_contract, RS.reader_contract) }}</div>
    <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px;margin-top:6px">{{ t(RS.disclaimer, RS.disclaimer) }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {# mtf-monitor (Multi-timeframe technical monitor) retired — folded into the Market State command-center #}

  <!-- ============ MACRO NOWCAST · CONDITIONS · RISK APPETITE ============ -->
  {% if latest.dislocation %}
  {% set DL = latest.dislocation %}
  {% set DI = DL.inputs %}
  {% set vcolor = 'var(--up)' if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' else ('var(--down)' if DL.verdict=='stand_aside' else 'var(--muted)') %}
  {% if DL.dislocation_active %}{# only renders when a real dislocation is firing; CSS floats it to the very top #}
  <div class="panel span12 dislo-lit" id="dislocation" style="--lit:{{ vcolor }}">
    <h2>{{ t('Dislocation Gate-1 · buyable washout vs falling knife', '错位一道闸 · 可买入错杀 对 接飞刀') }}
      {{ help("A risk FILTER that sits in FRONT of the capitulation gauge: when a stress dislocation hits (VIX panic, a >10% drawdown, a variance-premium extreme or VIX backwardation), it asks ONE question — is the Fed put present? PUT-ABSENT = a recession is underway (real-time Sahm >= 0.50) OR inflation locks the Fed (sustained 10y breakeven >= 2.5%). The whole edge is in REFUSING the falling knife (2000/2008/2022), not in catching the bounce — measured on SPY 1997-2026, see research/DISLOCATION_VALIDATION.md.", "位于恐慌触底指标之前的风险过滤器：当压力错位出现（VIX 恐慌、>10% 回撤、方差溢价极端或 VIX 倒挂）时，它只问一个问题 — 美联储托底是否在位？托底缺失＝衰退进行中（实时 Sahm ≥ 0.50）或通胀锁住美联储（持续十年期盈亏平衡 ≥ 2.5%）。全部优势在于拒绝接飞刀（2000／2008／2022），而非抄到反弹 — 基于标普 1997-2026 实测。") }}
    </h2>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">{{ t('A risk filter, not a buy signal. The edge is in refusing the knife, not catching the bounce — judged on drawdown, not return.', '这是风险过滤器而非买入信号。优势在于拒绝接飞刀，而非抄到反弹 — 以回撤而非回报衡量。') }}</p>
    <div class="grid">

      <!-- verdict hero -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ vcolor }};border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:{{ vcolor }}">
          {% if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' %}{{ t('Buyable washout', '可买入的错杀') }}
          {% elif DL.verdict=='stand_aside' %}{{ t('Stand aside — falling knife', '观望 — 接飞刀风险') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('No acute dislocation', '无急性错位') }}{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:6px">
          {% if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' %}{{ t('A stress dislocation with the Fed put intact (no recession, inflation not blocking easing). Historically these mean-revert with shallower median drawdown — confirm into stabilization, do not anticipate.', '压力错位且美联储托底在位（无衰退、通胀不阻碍宽松）。历史上此类回归均值且中位回撤更浅 — 在企稳中确认，勿提前抢跑。') }}
          {% elif DL.verdict=='stand_aside' %}{{ t('A stress dislocation with the Fed put ABSENT. This is the 2000/2008/2022 regime where the same capitulation signals kept falling.', '压力错位且美联储托底缺失。这是 2000／2008／2022 情形，同样的恐慌信号仍持续下跌。') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('Markets are not in a stress washout — the filter is dormant and lights up only on a real dislocation.', '市场未处于压力抛售 — 过滤器休眠，仅在真正错位时点亮。') }}{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fed-put master switch -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        {% set pcolor = 'var(--up)' if DL.fed_put else 'var(--down)' %}
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Fed-put master switch', '美联储托底主开关') }}
          {{ help("The one out-of-sample-stable discriminator (holds in BOTH 1997-2011 and 2012-2025). PUT-ABSENT = recession underway (Sahm >= 0.50) OR inflation locks the Fed (sustained 10y breakeven >= 2.5%). Primary trend is shown as context but adds little on top of the switch.", "唯一在样本外稳定的判别器（1997-2011 与 2012-2025 两半区均成立）。托底缺失＝衰退进行中（Sahm ≥ 0.50）或通胀锁住美联储（持续十年期盈亏平衡 ≥ 2.5%）。主趋势作为背景显示，但在开关之上增益有限。") }}
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:{{ pcolor }}">
          {% if DL.fed_put %}{{ t('Put present', '托底在位') }}{% else %}{{ t('Put ABSENT', '托底缺失') }}{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:5px">Sahm <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.sahm) if DI.sahm is not none else '—' }}</b>
          · {{ t('10y breakeven', '十年盈亏平衡') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.breakeven_10y_1m) if DI.breakeven_10y_1m is not none else '—' }}%</b>
          · {{ t('trend', '趋势') }} <b>{{ t('up', '上行') if DI.primary_trend=='up' else t('down', '下行') }}</b></div>
        {% if not DL.fed_put %}
        <div class="sm" style="margin-top:5px;color:var(--down)">
          {% if DI.sahm is not none and DI.sahm >= 0.5 %}⚑ {{ t('recession underway (Sahm)', '衰退进行中（Sahm）') }}{% endif %}
          {% if DI.breakeven_10y_1m is not none and DI.breakeven_10y_1m >= 2.5 %}{% if DI.sahm is not none and DI.sahm >= 0.5 %} · {% endif %}⚑ {{ t('inflation locks the Fed', '通胀锁住美联储') }}{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if DL.dislocation_active %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('Stress triggers firing', '触发的压力信号') }}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
          {% if DI.vix is not none and DI.vix > 30 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('VIX panic', 'VIX 恐慌') }} {{ DI.vix }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.spy_drawdown_pct is not none and DI.spy_drawdown_pct <= -10 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('drawdown', '回撤') }} {{ DI.spy_drawdown_pct }}%</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.vrp_pctile is not none and DI.vrp_pctile > 0.9 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('VRP extreme', 'VRP 极端') }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.vix_term is not none and DI.vix_term >= 1 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('VIX backwardation', 'VIX 倒挂') }} {{ '%.2f'|format(DI.vix_term) }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.capitulation_active %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--up)">{{ t('capitulation', '恐慌触底') }} {{ DI.capitulation_signals|length }}{% if DI.capitulation_strong %} ⚑{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if DL.capitulation_caveat %}
        <div class="sm" style="margin-top:7px;color:var(--down)">⚠ {{ t('The capitulation gauge is firing, but the Fed put is absent — its measured bounce does NOT apply here (the falling-knife regime).', '恐慌触底指标在触发，但美联储托底缺失 — 其实测反弹在此不适用（接飞刀情形）。') }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if DL.catalyst_narrative %}
      {% set CN = DL.catalyst_narrative %}
      {% set cncolor = 'var(--up)' if CN.agreement=='corroborates' else 'var(--warn)' %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ cncolor }};border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">🧠 {{ t('Catalyst cross-check', '催化交叉验证') }}
          {{ help("An AI read of the actual catalyst TEXT (engine/catalyst_tone.py, DeepSeek) cross-checked against the Fed-put switch: does the document read as a reversible washout or a structural break? CONTEXT ONLY — it never changes the verdict; the validated gate governs. Shown only on an active dislocation when the read is confidence-passed and quote-verified.", "对实际催化文本的 AI 解读（engine/catalyst_tone.py，DeepSeek）与美联储托底开关的交叉验证：文档解读为可逆抛售还是结构性断裂？仅供背景 —— 绝不改变判定，以经验证的一道闸为准。仅在活跃错位且解读通过置信度与引文核验时显示。") }}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;color:{{ cncolor }}">{% if CN.agreement=='corroborates' %}{{ t('corroborates', '印证') }}{% else %}{{ t('diverges', '背离') }}{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('catalyst reads', '催化解读') }}: <span class="l-en">{{ CN.shock_reversible }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ CN.shock_reversible_zh or CN.shock_reversible }}</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm"><span class="l-en">{{ CN.note }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ CN.note_zh or CN.note }}</span></div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if DL.geo_reversibility %}
      {% set GR = DL.geo_reversibility %}
      {% set grcolor = 'var(--up)' if GR.agreement=='corroborates' else 'var(--warn)' %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ grcolor }};border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">🌍 {{ t('Geopolitical reversibility', '地缘可逆性') }}
          {{ help("A DETERMINISTIC reversibility cross-check from the GPR threat/act split (Caldara-Iacoviello, AER 2022): the THREAT component of geopolitical risk historically reverts (~3 months) while realized ACTS persist. The free, always-available complement to the AI catalyst cross-check above — shown only on an active dislocation when geopolitical risk is elevated (≥80th pct) and the threat/act mix has a clear lean. CONTEXT ONLY — it never changes the verdict; the validated Fed-put gate governs.", "基于 GPR 威胁／行动分量的确定性可逆性交叉验证（Caldara-Iacoviello，AER 2022）：地缘风险的「威胁」分量历史上往往回落（约3个月），而已发生的「行动」更持久。这是上方 AI 催化交叉验证的免费、始终可用的补充 —— 仅在活跃错位、地缘风险偏高（≥80百分位）且威胁／行动结构有明确倾向时显示。仅供背景 —— 绝不改变判定，以经验证的美联储托底闸为准。") }}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;color:{{ grcolor }}">{% if GR.agreement=='corroborates' %}{{ t('corroborates', '印证') }}{% else %}{{ t('diverges', '背离') }}{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('GPR reads', '地缘解读') }}: <span class="l-en">{{ GR.reversibility }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ GR.reversibility_zh or GR.reversibility }}</span> ({{ t('led by', '主导') }} {{ t('threats', '威胁') if GR.lean=='threat' else t('acts', '行动') }}{% if GR.gpr_pct is not none %}, {{ GR.gpr_pct }}{{ t('th pct', '百分位') }}{% endif %})</span>
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm"><span class="l-en">{{ GR.note }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ GR.note_zh or GR.note }}</span></div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if DL.gate2 and DL.gate2.state not in ('dormant', 'unknown') %}
      {% set g2 = DL.gate2 %}
      {% set g2color = 'var(--up)' if g2.state=='confirmed' else ('var(--warn)' if g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' else 'var(--muted)') %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ g2color }};border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('Gate-2 entry timer', '二道闸 · 入场时机') }}
          {{ help("The entry TIMER — it arms ONLY once Gate-1 says buyable, and it is a coincident CONFIRM, never anticipation: it waits for the VIX term structure to un-invert (backwardation back to contango), which historically lags the VIX peak by ~13 sessions. MEASURED on matched buyable washouts (2006+): waiting for the un-inversion lifted hit-rate 61->67%, median 3-month return +2.2->+4.6% and shallowed median drawdown -4.5->-2.9% — but the 1-in-10 tail was marginally worse. A confirm, not a bottom-caller.", "入场时机器 — 仅在一道闸判定可买入后才启动，且是同步确认而非提前预判：它等待 VIX 期限结构回正（由倒挂转为正向），历史上滞后 VIX 峰值约 13 个交易日。基于匹配的可买入错杀样本（2006+）实测：等待回正将胜率由 61% 提升至 67%，三月中位回报 +2.2% 升至 +4.6%，中位回撤由 −4.5% 收窄至 −2.9% — 但 1/10 尾部略差。这是确认，而非抄底。") }}
        </div>
        <b style="color:{{ g2color }}">
          {% if g2.state=='confirmed' %}{{ t('Re-entry confirmed', '入场已确认') }}
          {% elif g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' %}{{ t('Awaiting confirm', '等待确认') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('No timer signal', '无时机信号') }}{% endif %}</b>
        <span class="muted sm"> —
          {% if g2.state=='confirmed' %}{{ t('term structure un-inverted', '期限结构已回正') }}{% if g2.hook_days_ago is not none %} ({{ g2.hook_days_ago }} {{ t('sessions ago', '个交易日前') }}){% endif %}{{ t('; the mean-reversion confirm — wait for it, do not anticipate.', '；均值回归确认 — 等待它，勿提前抢跑。') }}
          {% elif g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' %}{{ t('term structure still backwardated; wait for the un-inversion (historically ~13 sessions after the VIX peak), do not anticipate.', '期限结构仍倒挂；等待回正（历史上约在 VIX 峰值后 13 个交易日），勿提前抢跑。') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('no backwardation to un-invert — the term-structure timer does not apply; rely on Gate-1.', '无倒挂可回正 — 期限结构时机器不适用；以一道闸为准。') }}{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- measured record (honest) -->
      <div class="span12 muted sm" style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:8px;margin-top:2px">
        <b>{{ t('Measured (SPY 1997-2026):', '实测（标普 1997-2026）：') }}</b> {{ t('put-present washouts had ~4pp shallower median 3-month drawdown than put-absent (95% CI [+0.3, +6.3]) — the one effect whose CI excludes zero. The larger hit-rate and 1-year-tail gaps point the same way, but their CIs span zero at ~10 effective crises, so they are carried by sign-consistency (leave-one-year-out 26/28, both split-halves), not significance. A drawdown filter, never alpha.', '托底在位的错杀其中位三月回撤比托底缺失浅约 4 个百分点（95% 置信区间 [+0.3, +6.3]）— 唯一置信区间不含零的效应。更大的胜率与一年尾部差异方向一致，但在约 10 个有效危机样本下置信区间跨零，故由符号一致性支撑（留一年法 26/28、两个样本半区），而非统计显著性。这是回撤过滤器，绝非超额收益。') }}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}{# /dislocation panel — only when active #}
  {% endif %}{# /latest.dislocation — DL/DI/vcolor stay set for the Fear↔Euphoria read #}



  {% set TL = {'monetary':['Fed','美联储'],'inflation':['Inflation','通胀'],'labor':['Labor','就业'],'growth':['Growth','增长'],'credit':['Rates','利率'],'fiscal':['Fiscal','财政'],'earnings':['Earnings','业绩'],'guidance':['Guidance','指引'],'analyst':['Analysts','分析师'],'deals':['Deals','并购/IPO'],'capital_return':['Buybacks','回购/分红'],'stocks':['Stocks','个股'],'macro':['Macro','宏观']} %}
  <style id="nb-css">
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin:2px 0 14px;font-size:11px}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-strip-h{font-family:var(--num);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);margin-right:4px}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-ev{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border:var(--rule) solid var(--hair);border-radius:7px;padding:3px 8px;background:var(--tile);color:var(--ink-2)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-ev b{color:var(--ink-1);font-family:var(--num);font-size:10px}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-relief{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;border:var(--rule) solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--rc,var(--ink-3)) 40%,var(--hair));background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rc,var(--ink-3)) 10%,var(--tile));color:var(--ink-1)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-relief.firing{--rc:var(--up)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-relief.building{--rc:var(--warn)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-acc{display:grid;gap:0;border:var(--rule) solid var(--hair);border-radius:11px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--tile)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-item{border-bottom:var(--rule) solid var(--hair)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-item:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-item[open]{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--link) 5%,transparent)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-sum{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 14px}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-sum::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-sum:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--link) 6%,transparent)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-theme{font-family:var(--num);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--ink-2);border:var(--rule) solid var(--hair);background:var(--panel)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-htitle{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--ink-1);line-height:1.3;min-width:0}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-item[open] .nb-htitle{color:var(--link)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-meta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--ink-3);font-size:11px;font-family:var(--num)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-chev{transition:transform .2s}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-item[open] .nb-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-body{padding:0 14px 13px;display:grid;gap:9px}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-sumtext{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink-2);margin:0}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-sumtext b{color:var(--ink-1);font-weight:700}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-pill{font-size:10px;border:var(--rule) solid var(--hair);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px;color:var(--ink-3);background:var(--panel)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-pill.tk{color:var(--link);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--link) 38%,var(--hair))}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-read{color:var(--link);font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-foot{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 16px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}
  body.page-macro #now-board .nb-cat b{color:var(--ink-2);font-family:var(--num);font-size:10.5px}
  html[data-lang="zh"] body.page-macro #now-board .nb-strip-h{letter-spacing:0}
  </style>
  <div class="panel span6" id="now-board">
    <h2>{{ t('Market news &amp; catalysts','市场新闻与日程') }}
      {{ help("Reputable, macro-relevant headlines — filtered, theme-tagged and ranked by impact. Press a story to open a condensed read. Plus the US high-impact event window and any active relief-radar snap. All CONTEXT — never scored; the mechanical model never reads it.", "可靠、与宏观相关的头条 — 经筛选、标注主题并按影响排序。点按展开精简解读。另含美国高影响事件窗口与正在触发的反弹雷达。全部为背景 — 从不评分，机械模型从不读取。") }}
      <a href="news.html" style="float:right;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--link)">{{ t('Full feed →','完整新闻 →') }}</a>
    </h2>

    <div class="nb-strip">
      <span class="nb-strip-h">{{ t('Next 14d','未来14天') }}</span>
      {% for s in event_strip[:8] %}<span class="nb-ev" title="{{ s.label }}{% if s.time_et %} · {{ s.time_et }} ET{% endif %}"><b>{{ s.type }}</b> {{ s.dow }} {{ s.md }}</span>
      {% else %}<span class="muted">{{ t('Clear — no top-tier US prints in the window.','空窗 — 窗口内无一线美国数据。') }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if regime_snap and regime_snap.status in ('firing','building') %}
    {% set RS = regime_snap %}
    <div class="nb-relief {{ RS.status }}">⚡ <b>{{ t('Relief radar','反弹雷达') }}:</b>
      {% if RS.status == 'firing' %}{{ t('a risk-on snap is FIRING','风险偏好急转 触发中') }}{% else %}{{ t('a snap is building — watch','急转酝酿 — 留意') }}{% endif %}
      <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400">· {{ RS.legs_up }}/{{ RS.legs_total }} {{ t('legs risk-on','项转向') }} · {{ t('velocity','速度') }} {{ ((RS.vel_pctile*100)|round|int) if RS.vel_pctile is not none else '—' }}%ile · {{ t('coincident, not a buy signal','同步信号，非买入') }}</span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if macro_news and macro_news.headlines %}
    <div class="nb-acc">
      {% for h in macro_news.headlines[:6] %}
      {% set tl = TL.get(h.theme, [h.theme, h.theme]) %}
      <details class="nb-item"{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary class="nb-sum">
          <span class="nb-theme">{{ t(tl[0], tl[1]) }}</span>
          <span class="nb-htitle"><span class="l-en">{{ h.title }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ h.title_zh or h.title }}</span></span>
          <span class="nb-meta">{{ h.source_name or h.domain }}{% if h.importance_score %} · {{ h.importance_score }}{% endif %} <span class="nb-chev">▾</span></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="nb-body">
          <p class="nb-sumtext">
            <span class="l-en">A <b>{{ h.importance }}</b>-impact <b>{{ tl[0] }}</b> headline{% if h.tickers %} in focus on {{ h.tickers[:3]|join(', ') }}{% endif %}{% if h.channels %}, touching {{ (h.channels[:3]|map('replace','_',' ')|list)|join(', ') }}{% endif %}.{% if h.importance_reasons %} Flagged: {{ h.importance_reasons[:2]|join('; ') }}.{% endif %} — {{ h.source_name or h.domain }}</span>
            <span class="l-zh">一条<b>{{ h.importance }}</b>影响级的<b>{{ tl[1] }}</b>新闻{% if h.tickers %}，聚焦 {{ h.tickers[:3]|join('、') }}{% endif %}{% if h.channels %}，涉及 {{ (h.channels[:3]|map('replace','_',' ')|list)|join('、') }}{% endif %}。{% if h.importance_reasons %} 入选：{{ h.importance_reasons[:2]|join('；') }}。{% endif %} — {{ h.source_name or h.domain }}</span>
          </p>
          {% if h.channels or h.tickers %}
          <div class="nb-tags">
            {% for c in h.channels[:4] %}<span class="nb-pill">{{ c|replace('_',' ') }}</span>{% endfor %}
            {% for tk in h.tickers[:5] %}<span class="nb-pill tk">{{ tk }}</span>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <a class="nb-read" href="{{ h.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ t('Read source','阅读原文') }} →</a>
        </div>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="nb-foot">
      <a href="news.html" style="color:var(--link);font-weight:700">{{ t('Open the full news feed','打开完整新闻流') }} →</a>
      {% if macro_news.n_kept %}<span>{{ macro_news.n_kept }} {{ t('stories kept','保留条目') }}{% if macro_news.n_raw %} · {{ macro_news.n_raw }} {{ t('scanned','已扫描') }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if macro_catalysts %}<span class="nb-cat" style="margin-left:auto">{{ t('Next catalyst','下个催化') }}: <b>{{ macro_catalysts[0].date }}</b> {{ macro_catalysts[0].type }} {{ macro_catalysts[0].label }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="muted sm">{{ t('No macro headlines right now — the fetch is off or the tape is quiet. Catalysts above remain live.','暂无宏观头条 — 抓取关闭或行情平静。上方日程仍保持更新。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}{# /mode != stocks — news & catalysts board #}

  <!-- Fear ↔ Euphoria synthesis merged into the #sentiment-regime scorecard near the top of the board -->

  <!-- ======================= ACTION BOARD ======================= -->
  {% if mode != 'macro' %}
  {% if action_board %}
  <div class="panel span12">
    <h2>{{ t('What to act on now', '当前可操作') }}
      {{ help("Your at-a-glance starting point — now spanning BOTH 🧩 narrative baskets (Memory & Storage, Non-AI Software, …) and 🏛 GICS sectors, because 'Technology' blends generational winners (memory/semis) with names being obliterated (non-AI software). Baskets give the narrative resolution sectors can't. HONESTY: a basket on the BUY side is a leadership LENS (≈), descriptive — cross-sectional momentum rank-IC is ~0 on the clean multi-decade backtest, so it focuses attention, it is not a return forecast. A basket on the REDUCE side carries a VALIDATED mark (✓): it rides the absolute-trend / fading-deteriorating drawdown gate, the one backtested edge (it roughly halved drawdown over 27y). ★ = currently in the narrative-rotation model book. Sectors keep their price-cycle read. Click any name for the full breakdown.", "你的一眼总览起点 — 现同时覆盖🧩叙事篮子（内存与存储、非AI软件…）与🏛GICS板块，因为“科技”把世代赢家（内存/半导体）与被血洗的标的（非AI软件）混为一谈。篮子提供板块无法给出的叙事分辨。诚实说明：买入侧的篮子是领先度透镜（≈），描述性 — 横截面动量 rank-IC≈0（多年期干净回测），用于聚焦而非预测收益。减仓侧的篮子带已验证标记（✓）：依托绝对趋势／衰退-恶化回撤门槛，这是唯一经回测的优势（27年里大致将回撤减半）。★＝当前在叙事轮动模型组合中。板块保留其价格周期判读。点击任意名称查看完整拆解。") }}
    </h2>
    {# Unified board: 🧩 narrative baskets (the AI-buildout-vs-rest resolution) lead each
       lane, 🏛 GICS sectors follow. Basket buys carry a leadership-LENS marker (≈, descriptive)
       and basket reduces a VALIDATED marker (✓, the absolute-trend drawdown gate); ★ = in the
       narrative-rotation model book. #}
    {% macro themeitem(x) -%}
    <a class="actitem ai-theme" href="{{ x.href }}"><span class="ai-bdg" title="Narrative basket — the narrative resolution (e.g. Memory & Storage), not the blurry GICS sector · 叙事篮子 — 比 GICS 板块更精细的叙事分辨">🧩</span><b><span class="l-en">{{ x.name }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ x.name_zh or x.name }}</span></b>{% if x.book_wt %}<span class="ai-book" title="In the narrative-rotation model book at {{ '%.0f'|format(x.book_wt*100) }}% — clears the validated absolute-trend gate · 已在叙事轮动模型组合中，权重 {{ '%.0f'|format(x.book_wt*100) }}%，通过已验证的绝对趋势门槛">★{{ '%.0f'|format(x.book_wt*100) }}%</span>{% endif %}{% if x.validated %}<span class="ai-val" title="Validated risk side — rides the absolute-trend / fading-deteriorating drawdown gate, the one multi-decade-backtested edge · 已验证的风险侧 — 绝对趋势／衰退-恶化回撤门槛">✓</span>{% else %}<span class="ai-lens" title="Leadership LENS — descriptive (cross-sectional momentum rank-IC ≈ 0 on the clean backtest); a focus aid, not a return forecast · 领先度透镜 — 描述性（横截面动量 rank-IC≈0），聚焦工具而非收益预测">≈</span>{% endif %}</a>
    {%- endmacro %}
    <div class="actiongrid">
      <div class="actcol act-buy">
        <div class="acth">🟢 {{ t('BUY ZONE — confirmed now', '买入区 — 已确认') }}</div>
        {% for x in action_board.buy_now %}
          {% if x.kind == 'theme' %}{{ themeitem(x) }}{% else %}<a class="actitem" href="{{ x.href }}"><span class="ai-bdg" title="GICS sector">🏛</span><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ x.ticker }}</span>{% if x.age_short %}<span class="actage">⏱ {{ t(x.age_short, x.age_short_zh) }}</span>{% endif %}{% if x.eq_badge %}<span class="eqmini eq-{{ x.eq_dir }}" title="{{ x.eq_tip }}">{{ x.eq_badge }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="acttag">{{ td(x.label) }}</span></a>{% endif %}
        {% else %}<p class="muted sm">{{ t('None today — nothing has fully confirmed a fresh cycle low.', '今日无 — 尚无标的完全确认新的周期低点。') }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="actcol act-soon">
        <div class="acth">🔵 {{ t('SETTING UP — buy soon', '构筑中 — 即将买入') }}</div>
        {% for x in action_board.buy_soon %}
          {% if x.kind == 'theme' %}{{ themeitem(x) }}{% else %}<a class="actitem" href="{{ x.href }}"><span class="ai-bdg" title="GICS sector">🏛</span><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ x.ticker }}</span>{% if x.get('days') is not none %}<span class="acteta">~{{ x.days }}d</span>{% endif %}</a>{% endif %}
        {% else %}<p class="muted sm">{{ t('No imminent setups.', '暂无临近的构筑。') }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="actcol act-trim">
        <div class="acth">🟠 {{ t('TAKE PROFITS / topping', '止盈／做顶') }}</div>
        {% for x in action_board.take_profits %}
          {% if x.kind == 'theme' %}{{ themeitem(x) }}{% else %}<a class="actitem" href="{{ x.href }}"><span class="ai-bdg" title="GICS sector">🏛</span><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ x.ticker }}</span>{% if x.age_short %}<span class="actage">⏱ {{ t(x.age_short, x.age_short_zh) }}</span>{% endif %}{% if x.eq_badge %}<span class="eqmini eq-{{ x.eq_dir }}" title="{{ x.eq_tip }}">{{ x.eq_badge }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="acttag">{{ td(x.label) }}</span></a>{% endif %}
        {% else %}<p class="muted sm">{{ t('Nothing topping.', '无标的做顶。') }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="actcol act-hold lst-wrap">
        <div class="acth">⚪ {{ t('HOLD / avoid', '持有／回避') }}</div>
        {# Hold + avoid stack up the most items (sectors + baskets); cap the column at 6 rows
           and fold the rest behind a Show more toggle (shared .lst-collapse primitive). #}
        <div class="lst-collapse lst-cap6 is-collapsed">
        {% for x in action_board.hold %}
          {% if x.kind == 'theme' %}{{ themeitem(x) }}{% else %}<a class="actitem" href="{{ x.href }}"><span class="ai-bdg" title="GICS sector">🏛</span><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ t("hold — don't chase", '持有 — 勿追高') }}</span></a>{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% for x in action_board.avoid %}
          {% if x.kind == 'theme' %}{{ themeitem(x) }}{% else %}<a class="actitem" href="{{ x.href }}"><span class="ai-bdg" title="GICS sector">🏛</span><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ t("wait", '等待') if x.tag == "WAIT" else t("avoid", '回避') }}</span></a>{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% if (action_board.hold | length) + (action_board.avoid | length) > 6 %}
        <button class="lst-more" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="lm-show">{{ t('Show more', '显示更多') }} ▾</span><span class="lm-hide">{{ t('Show less', '收起') }} ▴</span></button>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set _su = us_standouts if (us_standouts and us_standouts.buy) else None %}
    {% if _su or action_board.notable %}
    <div class="notable">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px">{{ t('Standout individual stocks', '表现突出的个股') }}</span>
        {% if _su %}<span class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px">{{ _su.buy|length }} {{ t('shown ·', '已显示 ·') }} {{ _su.eligible }} {{ t('fully aligned across weekly · 3-day · daily (bottoming, not a falling knife) · TWO gauges per card: an OWN-IT conviction score (leadership · quality · valuation) and a separate ENTRY gauge — buy now, or wait for the pullback to $X. A high score is NOT a buy-now; the green dot means the entry is open today.', '在周线·3日·日线上完全共振（筑底，而非接飞刀）· 每张卡片两个量表：持有信念分（领先·质量·估值）+ 独立的入场量表 — 立即买入，或等待回撤至某价位。高分并不等于立即买入；绿点代表今日入场窗口已开。') }}
          {{ help("Each name carries TWO independent gauges so a great company is never confused with a great entry. (1) OWN-IT CONVICTION (the 0-100 score): leadership (validated sector-neutral residual momentum α across the S&P 1500) + quality + a forward-aware valuation read — a cheap-on-forward leader like NVDA is NOT penalized for a rich trailing multiple. It surfaces leaders that aren't in any sector ETF's top-10. It is a within-market percentile DISPLAY skin (not a probability) and reads 'high-confluence (context)' until a deep Phase-0 proves forward edge; the α leg is just one light, regime-scaled input, not the rank key. (2) ENTRY TIMING (the coloured strip): the price-cycle read across daily/3-day/weekly — buy now (green dot), wait for the pullback to the shown buy-zone price, or extended/topping (don't chase). Two VERIFIERS — an Options (dealer-gamma) check and a single-stock volatility-squeeze read — sharpen the ENTRY only (display + a small bounded tilt); they can lower conviction but never manufacture a buy, and never touch the selection rank. The price-cycle state is a HARD modifier: a name late in its cycle, in a downtrend or topping, can NEVER read 'buy now' — it reads 'strong name, wrong tape', which is why this card and the stock's own page never disagree. The board is sorted by conviction; the entry gauge tells you which are actionable today. Click any card for the full breakdown.", "每个标的带有两个相互独立的量表，使“好公司”绝不等同于“好入场点”。(1) 持有信念（0-100 分）：领先度（在标普1500内已验证的行业中性残差动量 α）+ 质量 + 前瞻估值读数——像 NVDA 这种前瞻便宜的领涨股不会因偏高的历史倍数而被扣分。它能发掘不在任何行业ETF前十大持仓中的领涨股。它是市场内百分位的展示皮肤（非概率），在深度 Phase-0 证明前瞻优势前显示为“高共振（参考）”；α 维度只是一个轻量、随行情缩放的输入，并非排序关键。(2) 入场择时（彩色条）：跨日线/3日/周线的价格周期读数——立即买入（绿点）、等待回撤至所示买入区价位，或过度拉伸/做顶（勿追高）。两个验证器——期权（做市商 Gamma）检查与个股波动压缩读数——只优化“入场”（展示＋小幅有界倾斜）；它们可降低确信度，但绝不制造买入信号，也不触及选股排序。价格周期状态是硬性修正项：处于周期晚期、下行或做顶的个股永远不会显示“立即买入”，而显示“强势但趋势不利”，因此本卡片与个股自身页面绝不冲突。榜单按信念排序；入场量表告诉你今天哪些可操作。点击任意卡片查看完整拆解。") }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% if not _su %}<span class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px">{{ t('from each sector’s top-10 holdings · grouped by cycle entry, ranked by sector-neutral momentum (α)', '来自各板块前十大持仓 · 按周期入场分组，以行业中性动量（α）排序') }}
          {{ help("Every sector ETF's top-10 holdings are run through the SAME price-cycle engine as the sectors. A name earns a card only when its cycle signal is decisive — a confirmed buy (BUY ZONE), an imminent turn (BOTTOMING), or a sell (TOPPING). The cycle state GROUPS the cards (it places risk — a defined entry + exit); WITHIN each group they're ordered by the validated sector-neutral residual momentum (α — market + sector beta stripped). We Phase-0 tested blending the cycle timing INTO the rank (reports/setup-score-phase0.md, survivorship-clean S&P 500, 12y) and it did NOT improve forward returns — it diluted α — so the order rides α and the cycle/pullback is shown as risk-placement CONTEXT, not a return signal. A soft per-sector cap keeps one hot sector from crowding the board. The α / #rank / pullback line and the 👤 insider chip are context inputs, NOT standalone buy signals. Click any card for the full breakdown.", "每个板块 ETF 的前十大持仓都用与板块相同的价格周期引擎分析。只有当个股的周期信号具决定性时才会获得卡片 — 已确认买入（买入区）、即将转向（筑底）或卖出（做顶）。周期状态对卡片进行分组（它摆放风险 — 明确的入场与出场）；在每组内部，按已验证的行业中性残差动量（α — 已剥离大盘与行业 beta）排序。我们做了 Phase-0 检验，把周期择时混入排序（reports/setup-score-phase0.md，无幸存者偏差的标普500，12年），结果并未改善前瞻收益 — 反而稀释了 α — 因此排序以 α 为准，周期/回调作为风险摆位的情境展示，而非收益信号。软性的单一板块上限可避免强势板块挤占整版。卡片上的 α / #排名 / 回调一行以及 👤 内部人买入标记均为情境输入，并非独立买入信号。点击任意卡片查看完整拆解。") }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if _su and _su.buy %}{% set _tt = (_su.buy[0].conviction or {}).trust_tier %}
      <div class="nb-legend">
        <span class="lg-k">{{ t('Reading the cards', '如何看卡片') }}</span>
        <span><b>{{ t('Score', '评分') }}</b> = {{ t('within-board percentile RANK (today’s board), not an absolute 0–100 — the verdict is the absolute read.', '板内百分位排名（今日榜单），并非绝对 0–100 — 结论才是绝对读数。') }}</span>
        {% if _tt %}<span class="lg-sep">·</span><span><b>{{ t('Edge basis', '优势来源') }}</b>: <span class="l-en">{{ _tt.en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ _tt.zh }}</span></span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if market_gamma %}
      <div class="gamma-note gn-{{ market_gamma.regime }}">
        {% if market_gamma.regime == 'short' %}<span class="gn-ic">🌀</span>
          <b>{{ t('Short-gamma market', '空头 Gamma 市场') }}</b> — {{ t('S&P 500 trades', '标普500 现') }} {{ '%.1f'|format(market_gamma.spot_vs_flip_pct | abs) }}% {{ t('below its dealer gamma-flip', '低于做市商 Gamma 翻转位') }} ({{ market_gamma.flip }}): {{ t('dealer hedging AMPLIFIES moves — momentum extends but reversals snap back hard. Wider stops; don’t chase entries.', '做市商对冲会放大波动 — 动量延伸但反转剧烈。放宽止损，不要追高入场。') }}
        {% else %}<span class="gn-ic">⚖</span>
          <b>{{ t('Long-gamma market', '多头 Gamma 市场') }}</b> — {{ t('S&P 500 trades', '标普500 现') }} {{ '%.1f'|format(market_gamma.spot_vs_flip_pct) }}% {{ t('above its dealer gamma-flip', '高于做市商 Gamma 翻转位') }} ({{ market_gamma.flip }}): {{ t('dealer hedging DAMPENS moves — ranges hold and breakouts tend to fade. Fade extremes; breakouts need confirmation.', '做市商对冲会抑制波动 — 区间维持，突破易回落。逢极端反向，突破需确认。') }}
        {% endif %}
        {{ help("The whole-market dealer-gamma regime, from the VALIDATED index dealer-gamma read (S&P 500, engine.gex_engine — the same that drives the dealer-gamma board). ABOVE the gamma 'flip' strike dealers are net long gamma and hedge AGAINST price (pinning, vol suppressed); BELOW it they are short gamma and hedge WITH price (amplifying). This is market-wide vol CONTEXT for the setups below — how moves behave right now — NOT a per-stock signal. An estimate from delayed CBOE chains, not ground truth.", "全市场做市商 Gamma 状态，来自已验证的指数做市商 Gamma 读数（标普500，engine.gex_engine — 与做市商 Gamma 看板同源）。在 Gamma“翻转”行权价之上，做市商净多头 Gamma，逆价格对冲（钉住、压制波动）；之下则为空头 Gamma，顺价格对冲（放大波动）。这是对下方布局的全市场波动情境 — 当下波动的表现方式 — 并非个股信号。基于延迟的 CBOE 链估算，并非真实值。") }}
        <span class="gn-cav">{{ t('market-wide context, not a per-stock signal · est., as of', '全市场情境，非个股信号 · 估算，截至') }} {{ market_gamma.asof }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if _su and _su.dispersion_regime %}{% set _dr = _su.dispersion_regime %}
      <div class="nb-disp disp-{{ _dr.state }}" title="Cross-sectional dispersion regime — the dial for WHEN stock-selection pays. When names fan out (high dispersion / low pairwise correlation) selection earns the most and the book takes more gross (×{{ _dr.gross_mult }}); a macro-driven tape (low dispersion / high correlation) mutes it (de-gross to cash). Dispersion percentile {{ _dr.dispersion_pctile }} · avg pairwise corr {{ _dr.avg_corr }}. Sizes SELECTION conviction; never market direction. · 横截面离散度状态 — 选股何时有效的拨盘。">
        <span class="disp-ic">{{ '🎯' if _dr.state == 'lean_in' else ('🌫️' if _dr.state == 'lean_out' else '⚖️') }}</span>
        <b><span class="l-en">{{ _dr.label }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ _dr.label_zh }}</span></b>
        <span class="disp-meta">{{ t('gross', '总仓') }} ×{{ _dr.gross_mult }}{% if _dr.avg_corr is not none %} · {{ t('avg corr', '平均相关') }} {{ _dr.avg_corr }}{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="nbgrid" data-showmore="12">
      {% if _su %}
      {# Two-gauge board: one CONVICTION-ranked watch-list (buy + leaders-to-watch
