            {{ help("Actionable setups only. A name appears here only once it has TRIGGERED the validated MACD-2D × StochRSI-3D confluence buy (engine/signal_gate): the 2D MACD and 3D StochRSI have crossed within the last ~6 days and momentum is still constructive (Buy zone), OR the 3D StochRSI has crossed and the 2D MACD is about to cross in the next 1-2 bars (About to cross). This is a HARD gate — a high-α leader that is downtrending / topped on the 3D MACD/StochRSI is NOT shown, no matter how strong its momentum (the bug this fixes). Among the names that pass the gate, the board RANKS by α (sector-neutral residual momentum, market + sector beta stripped) so the strongest leaders surface first; the cycle state, trend chip and 'setup' score are risk-placement CONTEXT, and 👤 flags an insider buy-cluster. Click any row for the full breakdown.", "仅显示可操作布局。标的只有在触发了经验证的 MACD-2D × StochRSI-3D 共振买入（engine/signal_gate）后才会出现：2日 MACD 与 3日 StochRSI 已在约近6日内交叉且动量仍具建设性（买入区），或 3日 StochRSI 已上穿、2日 MACD 即将在未来1-2根K线内交叉（即将交叉）。这是硬性门控——无论动量多强，在 3日 MACD/StochRSI 上处于下行/做顶的高 α 领涨股都不会显示（本次修复的问题）。在通过门控的标的中，榜单按 α（行业中性残差动量，剥离大盘与行业 beta）排序，使最强领涨股优先；周期状态、趋势标签与“布局分”为风险摆位情境，👤 表示内部人集群买入。点击任意行查看完整拆解。") }}</span>
